OL,3,GNEWSAPsychiatric nurse neglected
OL,4,Apatient who took own life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mental health nurse who failed to
OL,7,Fcheck on a patient she had a "grudge"
OL,8,Fagainst before she took her own life
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for four years.
OL,11,FLaurence Tchapong, 54, was required to
OL,12,Fcheck Amy Barber, 22, every five
OL,13,Fminutes at the Brooklands psychiatric
OL,14,Fintensive care unit at Clatterbridge
OL,15,FHospital in Wirral, but Liverpool Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard Tchapong completed records
OL,17,Fsuggesting checks had taken place on 30
OL,18,FJune 2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
