OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPsychiatric nurse neglected
OL,4,Apatient who took own life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy was found unresponsive by a
OL,7,Fcolleague but could not be saved, and
OL,8,FCCTV showed Tchapong had not checked on
OL,9,Fher for 25 minutes.
OL,11,FTchapong, from Manchester, denied
OL,12,Fwilful neglect but was convicted
OL,13,Ffollowing a trial.
